From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 15:35:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/14] feat(trace): carry the trace report to the preview
 (ADR-396)

No visible change on its own. The worker and the cooperative inline
fallback now collect what a trace reported and return it with the result,
and the ready preview keeps it. A cropped boundary keeps the report of the
region it traced; a relaxed zero-path retry keeps the retry's report.

The next commits use it to start Manual brightness band at the threshold
the preview actually used and to show which route Line Art's automatic
detection took.

